+/**
+ * Inghain - Fashion Presentation Template
+ * Standalone pptxgenjs recreation of a 36-slide deck (10 x 5.625 in).
+ *
+ * Photographs in the source deck are replaced by flat colour placeholders
+ * (see `photo*` helpers); every other element is drawn with native shapes.
+ *
+ * Run:  node this-file.js   ->  writes the .pptx next to this script.
+ */
